Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,曾經有一個男人得到了世間的一切，傳說中的海賊王哥爾·D·羅傑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,他臨刑前的遺言驅使著人們奔向大海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,我的財富和寶藏嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.18,Main,,0,0,0,,想要的話就給你們吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,去找吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.87,Main,,0,0,0,,我把一切都放在那個地方了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,人們為了追尋夢想而出海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,世界迎來了大海賊時代！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:29.32,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:33.82,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.49,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:43.07,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise our flag to the Break of Romance Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366,460)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs40}Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:49.73,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let the waves crash, they'll jump start us out of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.84,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,438)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Time-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:54.26,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,If we're going to go to an incredible world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:54.26,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(277,493)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:58.79,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,you'll have to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:58.79,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(510,420)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.73,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Standing out too much, is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:04.62,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wanted → Means a Winner ( • v • )
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:10.50,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:15.99,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Forget our worries, just let the wind blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.52,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be the first to find One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.52,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1047,408)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:22.48,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our hearts dream beyond measure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:26.93,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,so let's never wake them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:29.41,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:33.54,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:37.33,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:44.72,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We... made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.62,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go... wherever our dreams take us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:52.70,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,and we won't leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:55.30,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go at it with all our hearts, that's a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:59.30,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,On that day when our dreams began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:03.72,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,we set our goals and they've never changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.24,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:10.61,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,The sun in my heart will never set!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:13.38,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:17.55,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.75,0:02:24.82,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:30.03,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:38.95,Title,Title,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}深海冒險！\N海面下一萬公尺！\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:44.59,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,沒有骨頭的生物⋯⋯沒有肉的骷髏⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:48.09,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,看來牠跟我完全相反。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}沒人在乎好嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:52.72,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你還挺厲害的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:55.20,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,嗯，這可不是每天都能看到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:56.92,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}你竟然悠哉地在素描？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:00.57,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我倒是無所謂，\N不過你有什麼計畫嗎，魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:03.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,問題是我們在水裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:06.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不⋯⋯不⋯⋯不⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,問題是牠有多大。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:12.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就算在海面上，牠也一樣危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:15.40,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,這群人到底怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:21.54,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,在這種情況下，大家齊心協力逃走\N不是理所當然的事嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,轉舵！航向正南方！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.75,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，娜美！直接朝章魚衝過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:29.57,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了！那隻章魚{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.57,Secondary,Sanji,0,0,0,,好了好了，娜美小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.62,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我在這裡⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.66,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,為了妳。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:37.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他撐住了！幹得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:41.10,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是因為復健的效果，\N而且娜美穿著外套！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:45.10,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,這艘船太危險了！我得自救才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:47.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有東西從後面逼近了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.20,Main,Coribou,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:53.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是剛才那艘船！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:56.75,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,乾利布！你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:00.68,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,你們回來救我了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.08,Main,Coribou,0,0,0,,我們來救你了，大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.65,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,{\i1}是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:10.08,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:15.46,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,鍍膜泡泡破了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:18.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}那艘船比千陽號還大耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:27.41,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,你們⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:29.44,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們看起來像水母。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.75,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,閉嘴，羅羅亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}牠直直朝我們衝過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.39,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:39.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,三檔{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你用大招的話泡泡會破的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.15,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}膽小鬼航行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:51.18,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們得想想辦法！不能逃走嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,別動！我要跟牠打！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:56.94,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}不行！泡泡會破掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:03.58,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,聽我說！如果你那麼想打的話，\N我有個主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.05,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,好，很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:09.39,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,這是即席踢水鍍膜！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:12.25,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,即席潛水服！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:16.49,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,如果我就這樣放任這群白癡，\N我也會跟著遭殃。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你幹嘛啊，外人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.31,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們應該逃跑才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:23.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這下子不得不打了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:29.44,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,我從一開始就說要逃跑了，\N但你們那個笨蛋船長根本不聽人話啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:34.04,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,你寧願他在船上大鬧嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:37.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好了，去吧！離船越遠越好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:39.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,如果你要打的話，\N就離船遠一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:41.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這條繩子很礙事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.92,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,救生索必須綁著！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.42,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不然我們會走散的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:52.00,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐在擔心我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們！幫我爭取一些時間！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要用一記強力攻擊解決牠。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:00.81,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那趁你準備的時候我把牠解決掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:02.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你會殺了牠的，所以不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要養那隻章魚的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.38,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,牠還在過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}佛朗基⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}打中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}好強！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}又一條觸手來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.23,0:06:29.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}為什麼只攻擊我們？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}防禦強化！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.92,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,直接命中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:37.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:39.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你⋯你擋住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:40.88,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,幹得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好厲害，喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.15,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,現在我們要撞上海底山了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.48,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}千紫萬紅⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.48,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}千輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.39,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨大手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.39,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}巨大之手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:53.72,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,巨大的手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.30,Main,Trio,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:59.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,做得好，羅賓！你救了我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.80,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,鬆了一口氣⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:06.74,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,雖然在水中，\N我還是在一瞬間做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}武裝色硬化！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:23.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,大海在⋯⋯吸走我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:29.69,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,該死的章魚，你想在他出手之前\N就封住他嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.29,0:07:31.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}藍色步行！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.39,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,香吉士先生離開他的泡泡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:37.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別管那個了！看他的速度！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,簡直像魚人一樣！太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:41.52,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,跑！跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:45.32,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,我花了兩年時間逃離那些噁心的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:50.35,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,跟他們比起來，\N這東西根本稱不上怪物。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:52.13,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,甚至有點可愛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:53.89,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔風腳⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:53.89,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔之腳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:58.79,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}全熟⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:58.79,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}全熟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.06,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}燒烤射擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:13.55,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}奧義三刀流⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.09,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}六道之辻！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.88,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,太⋯太厲害了⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:22.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我連他的劍技都看不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:26.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂，索隆，香吉士！你們把牠的觸手全部砍斷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.75,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:33.61,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}象槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:43.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他把牠打昏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:46.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他到底變得多強了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.20,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,咦？那裡有東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.19,Main,Straw Hats,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,鯊魚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,鯊魚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:57.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那條鯊魚穿著衣服嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.43,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那鯊魚還真大。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:01.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:12.31,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他們被捲入下降流了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:13.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,糟糕，追上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們必須待在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.99,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}我不想死在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.19,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,別鬧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯？那傢伙還在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:24.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}你怎麼這麼冷靜啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:29.34,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我的眼睛在旋轉！雖然我沒有眼睛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.95,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,保持桅杆水平！把船往左轉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:38.51,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們快撞上大陸棚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.73,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不小心的話船會被毀掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.73,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不要被甩出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.55,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,把船帶到海流的中心！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,速度好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:07.74,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:10.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我還活著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼了？為什麼愁眉苦臉的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:20.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,真是的，你們沒有我果然不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這裡好冷！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:28.47,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們找不到魯夫他們。看來我們走散了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:29.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:33.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,但願他們沒有被海怪\N撕成碎片才好。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你的想像力也太可怕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:39.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過在這片黑暗中，\N再怎麼找也找不到他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:44.83,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我不喜歡黑暗⋯⋯\N你們有沒有覺得被什麼盯著？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們現在至少已經\N下潛七公里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:52.49,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,在這個深度，壓力甚至能把鯊魚潛水三號壓成薄餅。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:55.03,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們離魚人島近了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:57.83,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,也許他們已經到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:02.81,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,卡蜜說過\N魚人島在海面下一萬公尺的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:05.49,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們還要再潛三公里？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:08.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們只靠那些小泡泡保護著。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:11.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就算還活著，氧氣也快用完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:15.21,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,所以我才說要把救生索綁著的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:17.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,哭也沒用。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:20.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們去找他們吧。我有裝設照明功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:21.45,Main,Usoppu and Choppa,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.84,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你說的是你的眼睛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.35,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}佛朗基⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:27.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}乳頭燈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,為什麼要在那裡裝燈啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:32.60,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(270,0)}這裡是深海層。光線無法到達、普通生物無法生存之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:37.42,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}真正的海底「暗世界」。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.42,Main,,0,0,100,,{\an8}快離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:45.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫！索隆！香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:47.85,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你們去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.71,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,回來啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:55.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,千陽之眼的照射範圍\N本來就沒那麼遠。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:59.19,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,真令人沮喪。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:03.12,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,這片黑暗讓人更加消沈。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這樣找下去也不是辦法。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:07.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:12.54,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,船無法減速，\N所以確保你們不要漏看任何東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:18.41,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,水母！上面有一隻巨大的水母！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:19.88,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.65,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,真的超大的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:26.62,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,在閃閃發光！看起來像星空一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:29.49,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,牠的觸手伸進來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.22,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,牠⋯牠想跟我做朋友嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:34.01,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不能碰牠，喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.56,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,牠搞不好有毒！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:36.99,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:39.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:42.13,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}小型風來爆發！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.11,Main,Usoppu ando Choppa,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,水母被吃掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:53.76,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,船裡的空氣好像減少了一些。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,總比被吃掉好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:13:00.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,風來爆發是消耗大量空氣的武器。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:05.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,但是，我們在水中。空氣是有限的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:09.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果把空氣噴出去，泡泡就會縮小！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:15.03,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}攻擊水母的魚翻肚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:17.06,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,果然是神經毒素。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:20.69,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,深海好可怕！又暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:25.89,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,而且有好多白眼睛的魚。好噁心！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:32.37,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,深海是一片黑暗的世界。\N因此這裡許多生物的眼睛已經退化了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:35.95,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,噢，所以牠們看不太清楚嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:40.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,笨蛋！你過來這邊試試！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.99,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,什麼？你問我沒有眼睛怎麼看得見嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:47.22,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,另一方面，\N有些生物的眼睛高度進化了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.41,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,答案是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:55.97,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,秘密！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:59.29,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你一個人在那邊幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:03.28,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不用擔心。我已經很習慣孤獨了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:06.92,Main,Usoppu to Choppaah,0,0,0,,魯夫，索隆，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.75,Main,Usoppu to Choppaah,0,0,0,,你們去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:14.14,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,這些繩子⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:16.16,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,大家？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.62,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你知道那個海賊怎樣了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,噢對，他也在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.94,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我完全忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:26.42,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.45,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,到了深海之後就沒看到他了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:32.69,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,也許他在下降流中被甩出去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:36.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,有可能。\N畢竟他的手腳都被綁著。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他什麼都抓不住。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:40.27,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不，你看⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:43.99,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他的繩子好像解開了。你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那⋯那他還在船上？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:48.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他會在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:52.11,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他可能躲在船裡某個地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:57.59,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,要我偷偷摸摸的話，我就照辦吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:59.40,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,比如女生的房間裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:04.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,該死⋯⋯連在自己船上\N都不能放鬆警戒嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:09.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別擔心。他也不是那麼強。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.14,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:21.69,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,跟海怪戰鬥的怪物三人組\N失蹤了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:28.61,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,靠那麼小的泡泡在這裡迷路，他們肯定死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:35.37,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,可惜無法取下草帽的人頭，但是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:39.78,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,只要我取下\N這艘船上所有人的首級，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:44.45,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,那就足以證明\N草帽已經死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.78,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,但是，別心急，乾隱布！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:51.56,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,不可以操之過急！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:55.13,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,現在殺了他們的話就沒人開船了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:59.80,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,這些傢伙很擅長航海。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:03.10,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,但是等到我們抵達魚人島的那一刻⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.26,Thoughts,Caribou,0,0,0,,就是他們的死期！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.07,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:15.57,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.59,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這下安全了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.59,Secondary,Caribou,0,0,0,,搞砸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:19.63,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他怎麼塞進這麼小的桶裡的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:24.49,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們太大意了。幸好這傢伙是個笨蛋，\N否則我們就有麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.29,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他的身體失去形體變成了泥狀物質。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:30.79,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他毫無疑問是惡魔果實能力者。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:33.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,而且還是自然系。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:37.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他之前故意挨打，假裝被抓住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:41.20,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂！請放我出去，大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:45.48,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,{\i1}穿泳褲的大人！我做你的僕人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:49.87,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,怎麼了，喬巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:53.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼，突然變得好熱。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:56.14,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我受不了熱。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:59.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好熱！怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:03.22,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,咦，這是什麼？煙？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,擋住我們的視線了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:07.90,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,海底冒出煙來？怎麼可能？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.13,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:11.95,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,難道是？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.27,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,海底熱泉沉積物！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:19.44,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這是一片海底火山地帶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.23,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,看！可以看出它們最近活動過。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:25.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們得趕快離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:27.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果其中一座噴發，我們會瞬間喪命！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.83,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好熱⋯⋯好熱啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.44,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,有東西追過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,肉食性管蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:42.23,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,沒有臉的螃蟹！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我完全不知道那是什麼東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:47.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}小型⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}風來爆發！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,深海好恐怖！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:56.81,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫他們不可能在這裡生存的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:18:00.79,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好難過。好不容易兩年後重聚了，\N結果⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別傻了！他們不會那麼容易死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:09.01,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們接連使用了好幾次風來爆發⋯⋯空氣快不夠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:13.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那是什麼？好亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:17.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,搞不好是魚人島！\N也許魯夫他們在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:20.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們還沒下潛三公里呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:23.17,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你⋯是⋯誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:26.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂！你用什麼東西發信號的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你看到什麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:30.56,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,還是太亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:35.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是鮟鱇魚！騙了我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.26,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我們被深海獵手捕獲了！\N情況不妙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好險！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:53.60,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,牠把我們引誘到牠的陷阱裡了！能逃走嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}又怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.05,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是⋯是人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.05,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:09.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}有著人類形狀的海怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:14.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}海入道！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}牠要把船掀翻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:24.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}那些魚呢？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:28.77,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,喂！鮟鱇魚！不可以那樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.78,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,不准吃船！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:34.41,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,我要說幾次你才聽啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:38.68,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,班德·乘肯船長會罵你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:41.25,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,牠⋯牠剛才是救了我們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:44.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快⋯快離開這裡！管牠什麼事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:46.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,兩個都是怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:56.97,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,死人不會說話也不知貪婪。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:56.97,Secondary,Brook,0,0,0,,那是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:20:02.76,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,在這個連烏鴉都不飛的漆黑國度裡，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:19:58.61,Secondary,Brook,0,0,0,,⋯⋯我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:07.99,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,死者不需手指上的珠寶。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:14.04,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,他們在黑暗中連自己的遺憾都看不見。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:23.18,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,搜尋吧！搜尋吧！\N所有沉沒的寶藏都屬於我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:30.73,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,我就是世界上最富有的男人，班德·乘肯船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:36.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}不可能⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:40.98,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\i1}竟然連海底都有？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:48.50,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\i1}不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:50.17,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\i1}是幽靈船！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:52.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你又為什麼害怕？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:56.06,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那⋯那是真的！看那面帆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:21:03.68,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那是傳說中的飛行荷蘭人號！\N那是一艘不該存在於這個世界的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:07.55,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那是許多世紀以前的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,某天，在一場暴風雨中，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.56,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,一艘船的船長突然發了瘋。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:19.83,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他開始把同伴扔進暴風雨中的大海，\N一個接一個地殺死他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:22.57,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他甚至朝上帝的臉啐了口水！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:28.29,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那位船長的名字就是班德·乘肯！\N而那艘船的名字就是飛行荷蘭人號！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:31.32,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他招來了上帝的憤怒，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:38.33,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,從此被詛咒在大海上漂泊，\N永世受折磨！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:45.64,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我們眼前的這艘船就是班德·乘肯船長那艘被詛咒的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:51.01,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,鮟鱇魚！瓦達茲米！如果你把船吃掉，我就拿不到他們的寶藏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:52.81,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,把它砸碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.19,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:58.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,哇！海入道⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:01.10,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,果然是敵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:03.42,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,佛朗基！使用風來爆發！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:06.10,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不行！燃料用完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:09.20,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,必須到能源室補充可樂！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.76,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,海怪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:26.58,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,北極之獸，海怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:28.21,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,你這混帳！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.35,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,給我住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:37.03,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你做得很好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.27,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:47.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫！索隆、香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.45,0:22:50.57,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我好高興你們還活著！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:54.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美桑！羅賓醬！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們一直在找你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:22:59.88,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們真的害我們好擔心⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.39,0:23:01.65,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,竟然跟我們走散⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:04.95,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,喂！醒醒，瓦達茲米！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:07.78,Main,Vander Decken,0,0,0,,再打一場！上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.35,0:23:14.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我跟香吉士的泡泡破了，所以我們擠進了索隆的泡泡裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:17.71,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,差點死掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:19.70,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不要讓我們那麼擔心！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:23.90,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,終於有空間了！果然還是家裡最好！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:27.30,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫！我好擔心你！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:31.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你的生命力真令人佩服！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:34.87,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,太不可思議了！你竟然馴服牠了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.95,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那隻巨大的章魚怪物？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:41.53,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒錯！我像專業人士一樣用牠來代步！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.53,0:23:42.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對吧，小章？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.64,0:23:44.93,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,為什麼取了一個魷魚的名字？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:48.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過牠也沒有真的在「拉」船耶。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.60,0:23:51.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,只希望牠別把我們捏碎就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.31,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:05.88,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不好了，班德·乘肯船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:09.26,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不妙！海底火山⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:09.95,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,要噴發了！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

